# The DeepFellow Dashboard, from webui2/, emits a different set of names than the legacy UI.
# They are listed here for the same reason as the names above: a UI build's output is generated, never committed.
# `apps/deepFellow/dashboard/src/_tests/singleInstanceBuildScripts.spec.ts` in the Modular Frontend repository pins
# the nine names that build emits, so a rename there fails a test rather than silently leaving a file untracked here.
# The ninth is favicon.ico, which both UIs emit, so it is already in the list above.
/static/apple-touch-icon.png
/static/favicon.svg
/static/icon-192.png
/static/icon-512.png
/static/manifest.webmanifest
/static/runtimeInjectedEnv.json
/static/tray-icon.png
